⚡🇺🇸🇮🇷🇸🇦 The Wall Street Journal reports that Saudi Arabia had refused an American request in May to use its bases and airspace for a US operation to secure navigation in the Strait of Hormuz during the war with Iran.

Washington then later hinted at reducing or delaying its defense support, including protection systems and weapons. After the subtle implications, Riyadh later backed down on its position after US pressure.

